                <section id="rs-hash">
                    <h2>What is RSHash?</h2>
                    <img src="https://via.placeholder.com/800x400?text=RSHash+Algorithm" alt="RSHash Algorithm">
                    <p class="image-caption">Figure 2: RSHash algorithm overview.</p>
                    <p>
                        <strong>RSHash</strong> is a simple, non-cryptographic hash function created by Robert Sedgewick.
                        It is known for its simplicity and decent distribution, making it suitable for hash tables and checksums.
                    </p>
